<?xml version="1.0" encoding="windows-1251" ?>
<string_table>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_rail_name">
     <text>Rail mount</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_rail_descr">
     <text>Allows to install various types of sights.</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_barrel_voronenie_name">
     <text>Barrel bluing</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_barrel_voronenie_descr">
     <text>A special heat-resistant coating makes the barrel more resistant to adverse environmental conditions, improving reliability.</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_usm_rpm_name">
     <text>Improved trigger group</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_usm_rpm_descr">
     <text>Increases rate of fire.</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_ejector_name">
     <text>Improved ejector</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_ejector_descr">
     <text>Modification of the case ejection system reduces the probability of malfunctions while firing.</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_barrel_narezka_name">
     <text>Rifled barrel</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_barrel_narezka_descr">
     <text>Barrel rifling increases muzzle velocity and accuracy, however makes the use of buckshot impossible.</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_light_details_name">
     <text>Lightweight parts</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_light_details_descr">
     <text>Reduces weight by replacing weapon parts with their light-alloy counterparts.</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_laser_name">
     <text>Tactical device</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_laser_descr">
     <text>Combines the functions of a narrow beam tactical flashlight and a laser sight. Particularly useful in night conditions.</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_plastic_mag_name">
     <text>Polymer drum</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_plastic_mag_descr">
     <text>A drum made of modern wear-resistant plastic reduces the weight of the weapon without affecting its other characteristics.</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_sights_name">
     <text>Tritium sights</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_sights_descr">
     <text>Tritium-illuminated sights increase speed and comfort of aiming in poorly-lit environments.</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_body_reliability_name">
     <text>Protective coating</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_body_reliability_descr">
     <text>Application of a protective coating to the internal parts significantly reduces wear.</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_stock_name">
     <text>Folding stock</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_stock_descr">
     <text>The stock makes it significantly easier for the shooter to counter recoil.</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_usm_recoil_name">
     <text>Muzzle brake</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_usm_recoil_descr">
     <text>A polymer buffer built into the weapon slightly reduces felt recoil.</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_handle_name">
     <text>Anatomical pistol grip</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_protecta_nimble_up_handle_descr">
     <text>Provides better grip for the right hand.</text>
</string>
</string_table>
